rce":"light","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"轻甲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dc82b8bd2a8963041d7c4696e28c3ededabfad24e2b4e2c81293b26eb1405100","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75a06ebd0ec88bd84bc49a960227fdb840a630b50ddd57ec1ba3bd2bc1fcf3d7","logical_entry_identity":"6a3d0142b8b9fbc01aee41197b8254bb8570f57857e6be8a065c0ebe7df2aef3","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"expensive goods","source_tag":"entity name","target":"昂贵货物"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eccb09d9d6be3a685e1474caf604d9c71245356a96612d362a4165b631202b88","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75aa2a58ee28c76f2913344dc6566c6c6fa6484a0073d92b9659370243497426","logical_entry_identity":"a860fc316a46641c8d3dc4d7f689ae1d49cee0b3085843ccaa7ed296d66f49d0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You replace your steamgun and attack with a lightning-charged staff to engage in close combat.\n\t\t\n\t\tDeals %d%% steamgun damage as lightning to enemies in a frontal arc, as well as reducing the damage they deal by %d%% for 3 turns. This counts as a melee attack but triggers ammunition on-hit effects. All shockstaff attacks will also make a shield slam for the same damage as lightning. \n\n\t\tYou can charge up to your steamgun's range to make shockstaff attacks.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将你的蒸汽枪替换成一根通了强电的电棍，用于进行近战格斗。\n\n\t\t在前方造成 %d%% 闪电蒸汽枪伤害，并降低他们所造成的伤害 %d%%，持续 3 回合。这一效果视作近战攻击，但可以触发弹药的命中效果。所有电击棒伤害也会附加一次盾牌攻击，造成同样的闪电伤害。\n\n\t\t你可以冲刺进行电击棒攻击，冲刺范围等于蒸汽枪射程。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4170608e3a484190005add82125fbdef80ca313d29a44ae3abe6bcd65b1277e3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75b9977a41f294f91bff57ed5c13f96d97367cd63255f24c4555dea772824934","logical_entry_identity":"1c2f1c0b6d493f3a4799dbf7aac22f12e85f9f85f1c5a3eaa889b4c372078fcb","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Project a radius 3 electric field from your shield lasting %d turns. Enemies within this field will take an automatic shield strike for %d%% lightning damage each turn, while allies will gain flat damage reduction equal to %d%% (%d) of block value.\n\t\tAll damage reduced by this effect will be stored for Capacitor Discharge.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"从盾牌投射一道半径 3 码、持续 %d 回合的电场。电场内的敌人每回合会自动受到一次盾牌攻击，造成 %d%% 闪电盾牌伤害；盟友则获得相当于格挡值 %d%%（%d）的固定伤害减免。\n\t\t此效果减免的全部伤害都会为“电力放出”储存。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f8bad79b3a7248c37b458b1f2bd0182064ea497a0348c33f3a8a718d63a3e8fe","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75bee66d93b6a239f7b48f4ca65ff63ea822331f2fa88e3977648b4b0302be52","logical_entry_identity":"bd5e8092219113d42671be0f43927eb4117bc779098209cfd0d6698198e2b482","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"pillar of the sun","source_tag":"entity name","target":"日之柱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3de5cc2be44994d358f7cec5817e6609b0a09c08d9c1c7394989ce46ecb7cbf2","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75d5a2e7d8d942ce32b0719616a189e9136d626e874d1f48c64160411ba732a0","logical_entry_identity":"b01d8dc21ac8659ea7d05121aed9063759e944ed9a67e42e30609bdca17d91e6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"a transcribed speech","source_tag":"_t","target":"记载的一份演说"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2bf2e6bb0c7351f3620661e8e00dc1814a63dfb26bdd09c37a6708f9750cf4c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"75e077f8d74cbd04032ccd507e41eac68a87c492f6fd5dd86c5396f9c19b5d1f","logical_entry_identity":"5761107a17e809f0fb5ac7d1ab2d70b93bef0ba2319dc9d85bda18b232b0b707","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"\"Have you ever fired a shot into a group of monsters and thought 'there must be a better way?' Well now, there is!\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"「你是否曾朝一群怪物开了一枪，心想‘一定有更好的办法’？现在，办法来了！」"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec3ec817c618825dca5ce732853b8a4ddca0acf1fa2f355d9244ae7c872ca108","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"760d58bf68e5cbc5e36dac1e291756256630af9370ed37649ab6b5688414a637","logical_entry_identity":"401151ec1ef951870886fc1dc29b16931d776627d00edd356b8289ba7faf1a14","normalized_pat